# door_pane: a plain flat glass pane (uniform, no stile/border), hinge edge at x=0, leaf along +X
# to x=0.9, base at z=0, height 2.0, 0.03 m thick. The door plugin rescales it to each opening.
o door_pane
v 0.0 -0.015 0.0
v 0.9 -0.015 0.0
v 0.9 0.015 0.0
v 0.0 0.015 0.0
v 0.0 -0.015 2.0
v 0.9 -0.015 2.0
v 0.9 0.015 2.0
v 0.0 0.015 2.0
f 1 3 2
f 1 4 3
f 5 6 7
f 5 7 8
f 1 2 6
f 1 6 5
f 4 8 7
f 4 7 3
f 1 5 8
f 1 8 4
f 2 3 7
